#==============================================================================================
#
#   length_style_value - LengthStyleValue: a <length>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/LengthStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-44) and the inline members
#       of LengthStyleValue.h.
#       LengthStyleValue::create's statics (the 0px and 1px values) are module variables made in the
#       C heap on first use (`with memory.heap`), as r36's CounterStyle statics: the collector neither
#       scans nor sweeps module data.
